reveal.en:
A minimal auto-configuration class is small on purpose:

```java
@AutoConfiguration
@ConditionalOnClass(InvoiceClient.class)
@EnableConfigurationProperties(InvoiceProperties.class)
public class InvoiceAutoConfiguration {

    @Bean
    @ConditionalOnMissingBean
    InvoiceClient invoiceClient(InvoiceProperties properties) {
        return new InvoiceClient(properties.baseUrl(), properties.apiKey());
    }
}
```

Four annotations, four jobs:

- **`@AutoConfiguration`** — marks the class as a Boot auto-configuration.
- **`@ConditionalOnClass(InvoiceClient.class)`** — do nothing unless the library is actually present.
- **`@EnableConfigurationProperties(InvoiceProperties.class)`** — bind and register the typed settings.
- **`@Bean` + `@ConditionalOnMissingBean`** — a small factory method producing an overridable default.

Note what is *absent*: no business logic (that is the client library) and no component scanning of the application's packages.

reveal.ru:
Минимальный класс auto-configuration намеренно маленький:

```java
@AutoConfiguration
@ConditionalOnClass(InvoiceClient.class)
@EnableConfigurationProperties(InvoiceProperties.class)
public class InvoiceAutoConfiguration {

    @Bean
    @ConditionalOnMissingBean
    InvoiceClient invoiceClient(InvoiceProperties properties) {
        return new InvoiceClient(properties.baseUrl(), properties.apiKey());
    }
}
```

Четыре аннотации — четыре задачи:

- **`@AutoConfiguration`** — помечает класс как auto-configuration в Boot.
- **`@ConditionalOnClass(InvoiceClient.class)`** — не делать ничего, если библиотеки в classpath нет.
- **`@EnableConfigurationProperties(InvoiceProperties.class)`** — привязать и зарегистрировать типизированные настройки.
- **`@Bean` + `@ConditionalOnMissingBean`** — маленький factory method, дающий переопределяемый default.

Обратите внимание, чего здесь *нет*: бизнес-логики (она в client library) и component scanning пакетов приложения.

